                    Text. Drafted by Davies; cleared by Kohler, Davis, McSweeney, AF, EUR/P, RA/P,
                    and USIA; and approved by Tubby.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d16-f2" n="1" xml:id="d16-f2-content">
                <p>For text of this declaration, see the World Marxist Review, December 1960, vol.
                    3, No. 12; an extract is printed in <hi rendition="#italic">RIIA Documents on
                        International Affairs, 1960</hi>, New York, 1964, pp. 222 ff.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
